Rule 13 (shape of mat must be compatible with the number of columns in input if input is 2D)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = 2 ∧ ndim(v_2) = 2 then shape(v_1, 1) = shape(v_2, 0)
